#: includes/functions.php
msgid "Impossible threshold: The Warning Trigger Count must be less than or equal to the Trigger Count or eval to 1!"
msgstr "Urwego ntarengwa rudashoboka: Umubare w'Ibikurura Iburira ugomba kuba muto cyangwa ungana n'Umubare w'Ibikurura cyangwa ungana na 1!"

#: includes/functions.php
