msgid "Checking this box will disable Alerting on all Thresholds.  This can be used when it is necessary to perform maintenance on your network."
msgstr "Guhitamo aka gasanduku bizahagarika Gutanga Intabaza ku nzego ntarengwa zose. Ibi bishobora gukoreshwa igihe ari ngombwa gukora imirimo yo gusana ku muyoboro wawe."

#: includes/settings.php
