#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Consider Unknown Data as Zero"
msgstr "Fata Amakuru Atazwi nka Zeru"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "When checking Thresholds, if a Data Source returns Unknown Data ('U'), consider the value as zero for the Threshold check. You can also enable log this issue."
msgstr "Mu gihe hasuzumwa Inzego ntarengwa, niba Inkomoko y'Amakuru igaruye Amakuru atazwi ('U'), fata ako gaciro nka zeru mu isuzuma ry'Urwego ntarengwa. Ushobora no gufungura ibika ry'icyo kibazo muri raporo."

