#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Empty ifHighSpeed Default"
msgstr "Ubusa bwa ifHighSpeed Mburabuzi"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "When calculating Expression Thresholds, if the ifHighSpeed and ifSpeed come back as zero, use the following ifHighSpeed setting instead.  Default ifHighSpeed will be 10000 for 10GE interfaces."
msgstr "Mu gihe habarwa Inzego ntarengwa z'interuro, niba ifHighSpeed na ifSpeed bigarutse ari zeru, koresha iri genamiterere rya ifHighSpeed rikurikira aho kubikoresha. Agaciro gasanzwe ka ifHighSpeed kazaba 10000 ku miyoboro ya 10GE."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Notification Preferences"
msgstr "Ibyifuzo by'imenyesha"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Disable Legacy Notifications"
msgstr "Hagarika Imenyekanisha rya Kera"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Checking this box will disable Legacy Alerting on all Thresholds.  Legacy Alerting is defined as any Specific Email Alerts not associated with a Notification List."
msgstr "Guhitamo aka gasanduku bizahagarika Gutanga Intabaza kwa kera ku nzego ntarengwa zose. Gutanga Intabaza kwa kera gusobanurwa nk'Intabaza zihariye z'Imeyili zidahujwe n'Urutonde rwo kumenyesha."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Threshold Notification Templated"
msgstr "Imenyesha ry'Urwego ntarengwa rishingiye ku nyandikorugero"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If checked, when creating at Threshold Template, its Notification Settings will, by default be owned by the Threshold Template."
msgstr "Niba bihiswemo, igihe uhanga Inyandikorugero y'Urwego ntarengwa, Amagenamiterere yayo y'Imenyesha mu buryo busanzwe azagengwa n'Inyandikorugero y'Urwego ntarengwa."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Enable Command Execution"
msgstr "Fungura Ishyirwa mu Bikorwa ry'Amabwiriza"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Checking this box will enable the ability to run commands on Threshold breach and restoral events."
msgstr "Guhitamo aka gasanduku bizafungura ubushobozi bwo gukoresha amabwiriza igihe habaye kurenga ku Rwego ntarengwa n'igihe bisubiye ku murongo."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Enable Per Thold Notification"
msgstr "Fungura Imenyesha kuri Buri Thold"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Checking this box will enable the ability to maintain custom Email bodies for Thresholds."
msgstr "Guhitamo aka gasanduku bizafungura ubushobozi bwo kubika inyandiko zihariye z'Imeyili ku nzego ntarengwa."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Enable Notification Queue"
msgstr "Fungura Umurongo w'Amamenyesha"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Checking this box will switch Thold from performing inline Notification to using either the Notification Daemon, or notifications performed out of band by the Notification poller."
msgstr "Guhitamo aka gasanduku bizahindura Thold ive mu gutanga imenyekanisha ako kanya ijye mu gukoresha Notification Daemon, cyangwa imenyekanisha rikorwa mu buryo butandukanye n'ikusanyamakuru ryo kumenyesha."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Enable Sending Alert Emails to Warning Notification Lists"
msgstr "Fungura Kohereza Ameyili y'Impuruza ku Ntonde z'Amamenyesha y'Iburira"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Check this box if you wish Warning Notification List recipients to receive Alert Emails in addition to the Alert Notification list receivers.  This case is applicable when Warning Notifications goes to Administrators and Alert Notifications go to Management."
msgstr "Hitamo aka gasanduku niba wifuza ko abari ku rutonde rwo kumenyeshwa Iburira bahabwa Imeyili z'intabaza ziyongera ku bo ku rutonde rwo kumenyeshwa Intabaza. Ibi bikora iyo imenyekanisha ry'Iburira rijya ku bayobozi ba sisitemu naho imenyekanisha ry'Intabaza rikajya ku buyobozi bukuru."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Threshold Daemon"
msgstr "Daemon y'Urwego ntarengwa"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Enable Threshold Daemon"
msgstr "Fungura Serivisi y'Urwego ntarengwa"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Checking this box will enable the use of a dedicated Threshold daemon. This can be used to increase system performance and/or to distribute Threshold monitoring to a separate server."
msgstr "Guhitamo aka gasanduku bizafungura ikoreshwa rya Threshold daemon yihariye. Ibi bishobora gukoreshwa mu kongera imikorere ya sisitemu na/cyangwa kugabanya igenzura ry'Urwego ntarengwa kuri seriveri yihariye."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Force Threshold Daemon Debug"
msgstr "Hatira Igenzura ry'amakosa ya Daemon y'Urwego ntarengwa"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Checking this box will enable Threshold Daemon debug when operating from SystemD or through the command line.  This change is dynamic and will take effect as soon as the next Threshold loop commences."
msgstr "Guhitamo aka gasanduku bizafungura ikurikirana ry'amakosa rya Threshold Daemon igihe ikora iturutse kuri SystemD cyangwa mu murongo w'amabwiriza. Iri hinduka rihita rikora kandi rizatangira gukurikizwa ako kanya umuzenguruko ukurikira w'Urwego ntarengwa utangiye."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Daemon Down Notification Frequency"
msgstr "Inshuro z'imenyesha igihe Daemon yahagaze"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If the Thold Daemon is found to be down, send out an Email notification at this frequency."
msgstr "Niba bigaragaye ko Thold Daemon yahagaze, ohereza imenyesha rya Imeyili kuri iki gipimo cy'inshuro."

#: includes/settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "Every %d Hour"
msgstr "Buri isaha %d"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Daemon Threads"
msgstr "Imirongo y'ibikorwa ya Daemon"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "The number of daemon threads to be handled by the Threshold Daemon."
msgstr "Umubare w'imirongo y'ibikorwa ya daemon izayoborwa na Daemon y'Urwego ntarengwa."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "1 Process"
msgstr "Igikorwa 1"

#: includes/settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Processes"
msgstr "Ibikorwa %d"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Logging"
msgstr "Inyandiko z'ibikorwa"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Log Threshold Breaches"
msgstr "Andika mu ikayi ibirenga urwego ntarengwa"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Enable logging of all Threshold failures to the Cacti Log."
msgstr "Fungura kwandika ugutsindwa kose kw'Urwego ntarengwa mu nyandiko y'ibikorwa ya Cacti."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Show Data Source in Log"
msgstr "Erekana Inkomoko y'Amakuru mu nyandiko y'ibikorwa"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Show the Data Source name in the Log if not present."
msgstr "Erekana izina ry'Inkomoko y'Amakuru mu nyandiko y'ibikorwa niba ritarimo."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Log Threshold Changes"
msgstr "Andika mu ikayi impinduka z'urwego ntarengwa"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Enable logging of all Threshold changes to the Cacti Log."
msgstr "Fungura kwandika impinduka zose z'Urwego ntarengwa mu nyandiko y'ibikorwa ya Cacti."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Debug Log"
msgstr "Inyandiko y'amakuru yo gukemura ibibazo"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Enable logging of debug messages with Threshold"
msgstr "Fungura kwandika ubutumwa bwo gukosora amakosa hamwe n'Urwego ntarengwa"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Alert Log Retention"
msgstr "Igihe cyo kubika Inyandiko z'Integuza"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Keep Threshold Logs for this number of days."
msgstr "Bika inyandiko z'urwego ntarengwa mu gihe cy'iyi minsi."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Log action Consider Unknown Data as Zero"
msgstr "Andika mu ikayi igikorwa cyo gufata amakuru atazwi nka zeru"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "When 'Consider Unknown Data as Zero' is enabled, log when it occurs"
msgstr "Iyo 'Fata Amakuru Atazwi nka Zeru' yafunguwe, wandike igihe bibayeho"

#: includes/settings.php thold.php thold_templates.php
msgid "Syslog Settings"
msgstr "Amagenamiterere ya Syslog"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Syslog Enabled"
msgstr "Syslog yafunguwe"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If checked, when creating a new Threshold, by default new Threshold events will be sent to your local syslog.  This setting is a preset.  Threshold settings dictate actual syslog control."
msgstr "Niba bihiswemo, igihe uhanga Urwego ntarengwa rushya, mu buryo busanzwe ibikorwa bishya by'Urwego ntarengwa bizajya byoherezwa kuri syslog yawe y'imbere. Iri genamiterere ni iribanze. Amagenamiterere y'Urwego ntarengwa ni yo agena igenzura nyaryo rya syslog."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Default Priority/Level"
msgstr "Uburemere/Urwego mburabuzi"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "This is the default Priority/Level that Thold will use to send syslog messages.  This setting is a preset.  Threshold settings dictate actual syslog control."
msgstr "Urwo ni Urwego rw'Ibanze/Urwego rusanzwe Thold izakoresha mu kohereza ubutumwa bwa syslog. Iri genamiterere ni iryateganyijwe mbere. Amagenamiterere y'Urwego ntarengwa ni yo agena ubugenzuzi nyabwo bwa syslog."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Default Facility"
msgstr "Icyiciro mburabuzi"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "This is the default Facility that Thold will use to send syslog messages.  This setting is a preset.  Threshold settings dictate actual syslog control."
msgstr "Iki ni Igice (Facility) gisanzwe Thold izakoresha mu kohereza ubutumwa bwa syslog. Iri genamiterere ni iryateganyijwe mbere. Amagenamiterere y'Urwego ntarengwa ni yo agena ubugenzuzi nyabwo bwa syslog."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Alert Presets"
msgstr "Amagenamiterere yibanze y'Integuza"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Weekend exemptions"
msgstr "Amasonerwa yo mu mpera z'icyumweru"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If this is checked, Thold will not run on weekends."
msgstr "Niba ibi bihiswemo, Thold ntizakora mu mpera z'icyumweru."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Default Trigger Count"
msgstr "Umubare mburabuzi w'inshuro zikoreshwa mu gutangiza"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Default number of consecutive times the Data Source must be in breach of the Threshold for an Alert to be raised."
msgstr "Umubare mburabuzi w'inshuro zikurikiranya Inkomoko y'Amakuru igomba kurenga Urwego ntarengwa kugira ngo impuruza itangwe."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Re-Alerting"
msgstr "Kongera gutabaza"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Repeat Alert after specified number of poller cycles."
msgstr "Subiramo Impuguro nyuma y'umubare wagenwe w'inshuro z'ikusanyamakuru."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Baseline Presets"
msgstr "Ibyateguwe by'umurongo fatizo"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Baseline Time Range Default"
msgstr "Igihe mburabuzi cy'umurongo fatizo"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "This is the default value used in creating Thresholds or templates."
msgstr "Iki ni igipimo gisanzwe gikoreshwa mu kurema Inzego ntarengwa cyangwa inyandikorugero."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Baseline Trigger Count"
msgstr "Umubare w'ibitera impuruza ku murongo fatizo"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Default number of consecutive times the Data Source must be in breach of the calculated Baseline Threshold for an Alert to be raised."
msgstr "Umubare mburabuzi w'inshuro zikurikiranya Inkomoko y'Amakuru igomba kurenga Urwego ntarengwa rw'ishingiro rwabazwe kugira ngo impuruza itangwe."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Baseline Deviation Percentage"
msgstr "Ijanisha ry'itandukaniro ku murongo fatizo"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "SNMP Notification Options"
msgstr "Amahitamo y'imenyesha rya SNMP"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "SNMP Notifications"
msgstr "Amenyesha ya SNMP"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Threshold status messages (informs/traps) will be sent to SNMP notification receivers. This includes Alerts, Warnings and Restoration traps per default. Note: This feature requires the Cacti SNMPAgent plugin."
msgstr "Ubutumwa bw'imiterere y'Urwego ntarengwa (informs/traps) buzoherezwa ku bakira amamenyesha ya SNMP. Ibi bikubiyemo Impuruza, Amaburira n'ubutumwa bwo gusubira ku murongo ku buryo busanzwe. Icyitonderwa: Iki gikorwa gisaba umugereka wa Cacti SNMPAgent."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Disable Warning Notifications"
msgstr "Hagarika Imenyekanisha ry'Iburira"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If this is checked, Threshold will not send a notification when a warning Threshold has been breached."
msgstr "Niba ibi bihiswemo, Urwego ntarengwa ntiruzohereza imenyesha igihe Urwego ntarengwa rw'iburira rwarenzwe."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Disable Restoration Notifications"
msgstr "Hagarika Imenyekanisha ryo Gusubira mu Miterere"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If this is checked, Threshold will not send a notification when the Threshold has returned to normal status."
msgstr "Niba ibi bihiswemo, Urwego ntarengwa ntiruzohereza imenyesha igihe Urwego ntarengwa rwasubiye mu miterere isanzwe."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Emailing Options"
msgstr "Amahitamo yo kohereza imeri"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Send Emails with Urgent Priority"
msgstr "Ohereza Imeyili zifite Uburemere bwihutirwa"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Allows you to set Emails with urgent priority"
msgstr "Bigufasha gushyiraho Imeyili zifite ubwihutirwa bukomeye"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Send Alerts as Text"
msgstr "Ohereza Impuruza nk'Inyandiko"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If checked, this will cause all Alerts to be sent as plain text Emails with no graph.  The default is HTML Emails with the graph embedded in the Email."
msgstr "Niba bihiswemo, ibi bizatuma Impuruza zose zoherezwa nk'Imeyili z'inyandiko isanzwe zidafite Igishushanyo. Ibisanzwe ni Imeyili za HTML zifite Igishushanyo gishyizwe muri Imeyili."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Send Email separately for each address"
msgstr "Ohereza Imeyili ukwazo kuri buri aderesi"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If checked, this will cause all Emails to be sent separately for each address."
msgstr "Niba bihiswemo, ibi bizatuma Imeyili zose zoherezwa ukwayo kuri buri aderesi."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "From Email Address"
msgstr "Aderesi ya imeri yohereza"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "This is the Email address that the Threshold will appear from."
msgstr "Iyi ni aderesi ya Imeyili Urwego ntarengwa ruzagaragaraho ko ruvuyeho."

