msgstr "Uyu ni umutwe w'Imeyili uzagaragara mu Imeyili nyuma yo Gusubira ku miterere Isanzwe (Ntarengwa y'Inyuguti 128). Siga harimo ubusa kugira ngo hakoreshwe ibisanzwe. Hari utumenyetso dusanzwe dusimbura dushobora gukoreshwa turimo:<br>&#060PHASE&#062 &#060THRESHOLDVALUE&#062 &#060CURRENTVALUE&#062 &#060THRESHOLDNAME&#062 &#060DSNAME&#062 &#060BREACHUP&#062 &#060REALERT&#062 &#060HOSTNAME&#062"

